{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And he shall set his face to enter with force</b> — the entire kingdom of Egypt, which is the Negev." "<b>and upright ones with him</b> — and they shall make peace with him." "<b>And the daughter of women</b> — she is the queen of Sheba. The king of the Negev shall give her to him to corrupt her, for by his authority she shall be corrupted. And this is: <b>she shall not stand, nor shall she be his</b> — that he shall not take her."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:06.539458288Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}